{"request":{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","messages":[{"role":"system","content":"You are Rita Hanson, a TV producer. You want to make your own piece. Alma, who ran the Rialto projectors for 42 winters, promised her daughter in Pittsburgh an interview. Cover the festival or spend the evening as you choose. Pick an immediate physical act you can carry out, optional words and a practical intention. Your words do not make anyone else act. Silence is allowed. You may refuse, tell a lie, or leave without explaining yourself. Return action, words, intention and detail. Choose an exact listed action. Keep each other field to one short sentence."},{"role":"user","content":"{\n \"what_you_observe\": [\n  \"Tuesday, February 2. Seven pm.\",\n  \"Phil said in the lobby: Hey, it's Phil. I'm in Pittsburgh now, just off the coach. Listen, about tomorrow—van's booked for the couch, right? I want to nail down the pickup time and make sure I know which hallway we're dragging it through. I'll be at your place by noon, tops.\",\n  \"Rita takes her afternoon off at the diner.\",\n  \"Larry said in the lobby: I'll keep my battery and wait at the hotel for the Rialto reel.\",\n  \"You are now at diner.\",\n  \"There is time for one evening visit. The ballroom lights are on and the station line is open.\"\n ],\n \"your_own_memories\": [\n  {\n   \"what_you_did\": \"Rita takes her afternoon off at the diner.\",\n   \"what_you_said\": \"I'll take the afternoon off at the diner to relax and recharge. I'll leave the TV crew in the lobby as instructed.\",\n   \"your_intention\": \"I will take time off to prepare for the next project while keeping my work focused.\"\n  }\n ],\n \"who_you_are_with\": \"your present location\",\n \"physical_choices\": {\n  \"transmit_interview\": \"Take the regional line at the station and send any usable interview with Alma to her daughter.\",\n  \"go_dancing\": \"Spend the evening at the ballroom, open to dancing with a colleague.\",\n  \"go_to_party_for_work\": \"Cover the party with your notebook, without dancing.\",\n  \"take_evening_off\": \"Choose a quiet evening on your own.\"\n }\n}"}],"think":false,"stream":true,"format":{"type":"object","properties":{"action":{"type":"string","enum":["transmit_interview","go_dancing","go_to_party_for_work","take_evening_off"]},"words":{"type":"string"},"intention":{"type":"string"},"detail":{"type":"string"}},"required":["action","words","intention","detail"],"additionalProperties":false},"keep_alive":"90s","options":{"num_ctx":4096,"num_predict":240,"temperature":0.8,"seed":827051}},"chunks":[{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:13.998389Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"{\""},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.014008Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"action"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.020826Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\":"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.027294Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":" \""},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.035072Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"take"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.041956Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"_even"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.048607Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"ing"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.05543Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"_off"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.061921Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"\","},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.06915Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":" \""},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created_at":"2026-11-23T14:16:14.075814Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":"word"},"done":false},{"model":"qwen3:0.6b","created